            text: _("Well, Thursagan has reached a conclusion. He can’t finish the sceptre with the materials he has here, but he has the final plans for it, and all the jewels and gold he needs. Shouldn’t we leave now?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Durstorn",
            text: _("All this time and he couldn’t make it? Fine, we should try to leave... but it’s not like we could leave if we wanted to. We’re surrounded!"),
