            terrain: "Uu^Pr\\o",
            cells: "",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_terrain",
            terrain: "Uu^Pr/o",
            cells: "",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thursagan",
            text: _("You have no right to offer the Sceptre to the elves, Durstorn, it’s not yours to give!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Durstorn",
            text: _("I can’t believe what I’m hearing, do all of you want to die? Enough talk!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Durstorn",
            x: 14,
            y: 21,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Durstorn",
            text: _("You insolent fools can thank me later, I might not banish you once we are back home."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Durstorn",
            x: 5,
            y: 24,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Durstorn",
            text: _("Elf leader, I have an offer for you. You want the Ruby, yes?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            side: 2,
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "this_item.facing",
                value: "ne",
                mode: "value",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Glildur",
            text: _("My, you’re a bold little dwarf! You’ve brought me the Ruby?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Durstorn",
            text: _("I can get you the ruby, and much more treasure, if you allow my group safe passage."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Glildur",
            text: _("I see... well, we will not be fooled by your haggling and false promises. You were very foolish to come out here alone."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_music",
            file: "frantic.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Glildur",
            x: 6,
            y: 25,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            unit: "Durstorn",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_music",
            file: "the_king_is_dead.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_music",
            file: "casualties_of_war.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_music",
            file: "battle.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Rugnur",
            text: _("Well, I suppose he should have expected that, but I don’t like this. In any case, now we should try to get out of here."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thursagan",
            text: _("Yes. See the area to the northeast of us?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to",
            x: 35,
            y: 2,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 400,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:add_item",
            x: 36,
            y: 3,
            item_name: "",
            image: "items%2Fgohere.png",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 600,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thursagan",
            text: _("That’s where the fewest elvish guards are, we just might make it back underground before they block us completely."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Alanin",
            text: _("This plan, it isn’t worse than staying here to be killed, but it isn’t likely to succeed either. Even if it does, what will it accomplish? We will be cornered there."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thursagan",
            text: _("I don’t know if we will be cornered. That cave looks like it goes deep, and we can lose the elves in the caves, they move so slow there. Once we get out, we’ll make our way back to Knalga."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Rugnur",
            text: _("The country between here and Knalga will be swarming with elves. We had better head back to the abandoned mines north of the Arkan-thoria, where we gathered our gold and coal."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Alanin",
            text: _("That’s fine for you, you can run fast in caves, but I can’t! What am I supposed to do?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Rugnur",
            text: _("Well, you are a member of the Wesnothian army. Why don’t you rejoin it? See if you can run past those elves to our southeast..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to",
            x: 30,
            y: 36,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 400,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:add_item",
            x: 30,
            y: 38,
            item_name: "",
            image: "items%2Fgohere.png",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 600,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Rugnur",
            text: _("... and then ride south until you reach one of your outposts."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Alanin",
            text: _("I’m not going to do that, it’s suicide! And in any case, I’ve been with you for ten years, almost as long as I was in the Wesnothian army; I’d prefer to fight with you."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thursagan",
            text: _("You going south has more of a chance of success for you than staying here or going back to the mines! And getting news to Haldric of what has happened is also the best way to get help to us."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Alanin",
            text: _("I suppose..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Glildur",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "this_item.facing",
                value: "ne",
                mode: "value",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Glildur",
            text: _("Come out, dwarves, let’s get this over with!"),
          },
        ],
      },
